Arcanum CE patch 3 of 3 for innospect 0.2.0 (gogx, 2026-10-31).

The (6.4.0) pre-release marker keeps the five header flags that
innoextract drops only from 6.4.0.1 (setup/header.cpp); innospect gave it
the 6.4.0.1 table and misread every record after it. Review finding H2.

--- a/src/header.rs
+++ b/src/header.rs
@@ -1541,7 +1541,11 @@
         OPTIONS_V6_7
     } else if version.at_least(6, 5, 0) {
         OPTIONS_V6_5
-    } else if version.at_least(6, 4, 0) {
+    } else if version.at_least_4(6, 4, 0, 1) {
+        // Arcanum CE patch (gogx, 2026-10-31): was `at_least(6, 4, 0)`,
+        // which gave the `(6.4.0)` pre-release the 6.4.0.1 table, five
+        // flags short (the Window* flags and BackColorHorizontal, which
+        // innoextract keeps below 6.4.0.1 in setup/header.cpp).
         OPTIONS_V6_4
     } else if version.at_least(6, 3, 0) {
         OPTIONS_V6_3
